// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄
// Miryoku Layout
// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

/ {
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        backspace {
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            key-positions = <8 9>;
        };

        enter {
            bindings = <&kp ENTER>;
            key-positions = <16 17 18>;
        };
    };

    behaviors {
        mt_all: mt_all {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "MT_ALL";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <35>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            flavor = "balanced";
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
                    &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E        &kp R             &kp T        &kp Y  &kp U  &kp I             &kp O    &kp P
                    &kp A  &kp S  &kp D        &kp F             &kp G        &kp H  &kp J  &kp K             &kp L    &kp SEMI
&mt LEFT_SHIFT TAB  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C        &kp V             &kp B        &kp N  &kp M  &kp COMMA         &kp DOT  &kp FSLH  &mt RIGHT_SHIFT SQT
                                  &lt 2 GRAVE  &kp LEFT_COMMAND  &kp SPACE    &to 3  &to 1  &mt LCTRL ESCAPE
            >;
        };

        num_sym {
            bindings = <
        &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5    &kp NUMBER_6      &kp N7             &kp NUMBER_8   &kp NUMBER_9      &kp NUMBER_0
        &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans          &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp EQUAL      &kp MINUS         &kp PIPE
&trans  &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans        &trans          &kp LEFT_BRACE    &kp RIGHT_BRACE    &kp LESS_THAN  &kp GREATER_THAN  &kp BACKSLASH  &trans
                                    &trans        &kp DELETE    &trans          &trans            &none              &trans
            >;
        };

        nav_rus {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp PERCENT    &trans  &kp HOME  &trans    &kt END     &kp LBKT
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans         &trans  &kp LEFT  &kp UP    &kp RIGHT   &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans         &trans  &kp RBKT  &kp DOWN  &kp KP_DOT  &trans    &trans
                        &none   &trans  &trans         &trans  &trans    &trans
            >;
        };

        sym_func {
            bindings = <
       &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &kp LC(UP)  &kp C_AC_SEARCH  &kp LS(LG(NUMBER_4))    &kp LG(L)  &kp C_PREV  &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE   &kp C_NEXT    &kp LC(LG(Q))
       &none                 &none                 &none       &none            &none                   &none      &kp C_MUTE  &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN  &kp C_VOL_UP  &none
&none  &none                 &none                 &none       &none            &none                   &none      &none       &none              &none         &none          &none
                                                   &trans      &trans           &trans                  &none      &trans      &trans
            >;
        };

        device {
            bindings = <
       &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1  &bt BT_SEL 2  &bt BT_SEL 3  &bt BT_SEL 4    &kp F1   &kp F2   &kp F3  &kp F4  &kp F5
       &none         &none         &none         &none         &none           &kp F6   &kp F7   &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F10
&none  &none         &none         &none         &none         &bt BT_CLR      &kp F11  &kp F12  &none   &none   &none    &none
                                   &trans        &trans        &trans          &none    &none    &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        device {
            if-layers = <1 3>;
            then-layer = <4>;
        };
    };
};
